<%- layout('layouts/boilerplate') %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheet/style3.css">
<div class="about-container">
  <div class="about-header">
    <h1>Welcome to Kaksh</h1>
    <p class="slogan">"Your Room, Your Choice, Your Comfort"</p>
    <img src="/roomphoto/photo7.jpg" alt="Room Banner" class="about-banner">
  </div>

  <div class="about-content">
    <h2>What is Kaksh?</h2>
    <img src="/roomphoto/photo9.jpg" alt="Searching for rooms" class="about-image">
    <p>
      Kaksh is a community-driven room discovery and rental review platform. Whether you're a student, working professional, or traveler, Kaksh helps you find the perfect room with confidence.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <img src="/roomphoto/photo10.jpg" alt="Mission visual" class="about-image">
    <p>
      To simplify the room hunting experience by providing verified listings, honest user reviews, and a transparent feedback system.
    </p>

    <h2>Key Features</h2>
    <img src="/roomphoto/photo8.jpg" alt="App features" class="about-image">
    <ul>
      <li>🛏️ Verified Room Listings with Photos</li>
      <li>⭐ Leave and Read Real Reviews with Star Ratings</li>
      <li>📞 Direct Contact with Room Owners</li>
      <li>✍️ Easy-to-use Interface for Adding or Editing Listings</li>
      <li>🔍 Powerful Search and Filter System (coming soon)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Why "Kaksh"?</h2>
    <img src="/icon/icon.png" alt="Kaksh logo" class="about-image">
    <p>
      "Kaksh" means <em>room</em> in Hindi — a word that resonates with comfort, privacy, and personal space. This platform is built to help you find the ideal kaksh where you feel at home.
    </p>
  </div>

  <footer class="about-footer">
    <p>Made with ❤️ by <strong>Rishi Sharma</strong></p>
  </footer>
</div>
